msgid "plugins.generic.jatsExport.name"
msgstr "Automatic Typesetting & JATS"

msgid "plugins.generic.jatsExport.description"
msgstr "Turns the paper's final Word file plus its OJS metadata into a complete JATS 1.3 file: Arabic/English metadata, the body with nested sections, bold/italic, footnotes and tables, and references with DOIs. It also produces an HTML reading version, checks structure and completeness, and attaches the JATS file to the official JATS tab of OJS 3.5. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

