msgid "plugins.generic.jatsExport.docxHelp"
msgstr "For best results use Word heading styles (Heading 1, Heading 2…) for sections, real footnotes, and put references under a \"References\" heading. Everything before the \"Introduction\" (title, authors, abstracts) comes from OJS metadata, not the file. If references are entered in OJS, those are used."

